### PMS API — Full Test Suite
### Base URL: http://localhost:5259
### Run the app first: dotnet run --project PMS
###
### ORDER MATTERS — run requests top-to-bottom.
### Each section depends on IDs from prior responses.
### Copy token from the login response into @token below.

@base = http://localhost:5259
@contentType = application/json

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 0.  TOKENS  (fill these in after running the login requests)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
@adminToken     = PASTE_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE
@pharmacistToken = PASTE_PHARMACIST_TOKEN_HERE


###
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# 1. AUTH
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### 1a. Sign up — self-registration (always gets Pharmacist role)
POST {{base}}/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "fullName": "Test Pharmacist",
  "email": "pharmacist@pms.test",
  "password": "Test123!",
  "confirmPassword": "Test123!"
}

###
### 1b. Login as pharmacist — copy token into @pharmacistToken
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "pharmacist@pms.test",
  "password": "Test123!"
}

###
### 1c. Sign up a SystemAdmin account
POST {{base}}/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "fullName": "System Admin",
  "email": "admin@pms.test",
  "password": "Admin123!",
  "confirmPassword": "Admin123!"
}

###
### 1d. Login as admin (still Pharmacist role at this point)
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "admin@pms.test",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

###
### 1e. Promote admin account to SystemAdmin via DB (run once in psql):
###     UPDATE "AspNetUsers" u
###     JOIN   "AspNetUserRoles" ur ON ur."UserId" = u."Id"
###     SET    ur."RoleId" = (SELECT "Id" FROM "AspNetRoles" WHERE "Name"='SystemAdmin')
###     WHERE  u."Email" = 'admin@pms.test';
###
### OR via the API after you already have an admin token — assign-role (self-referential):
###
### 1f. Admin creates a PharmacyAdmin user (requires SystemAdmin token)
POST {{base}}/api/auth/create-user
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "fullName": "Pharmacy Admin",
  "email": "pharm.admin@pms.test",
  "password": "Admin123!",
  "confirmPassword": "Admin123!",
  "role": "PharmacyAdmin"
}

###
### 1g. Assign SystemAdmin role to an existing user
POST {{base}}/api/auth/assign-role
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "email": "admin@pms.test",
  "role": "SystemAdmin"
}

###
### 1h. Login again to get a fresh token with SystemAdmin role — paste into @adminToken
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "admin@pms.test",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}


###
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# 2. CATEGORY
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### 2a. Get all categories (any authenticated user)
GET {{base}}/api/category
Authorization: Bearer {{pharmacistToken}}

###
### 2b. Create category — Antibiotics
POST {{base}}/api/category
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "categoryName": "Antibiotics",
  "description": "Medicines that kill or inhibit bacteria"
}

###
### 2c. Create category — Analgesics
POST {{base}}/api/category
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "categoryName": "Analgesics",
  "description": "Pain-relief medicines"
}

###
### 2d. Get category by ID (use ID from 2b response)
GET {{base}}/api/category/1
Authorization: Bearer {{pharmacistToken}}

###
### 2e. Update category
PUT {{base}}/api/category/1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "categoryName": "Antibiotics (Updated)",
  "description": "Broad-spectrum antibacterial medicines"
}

###
### 2f. Try to create with Pharmacist role — expect 403
POST {{base}}/api/category
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{pharmacistToken}}

{
  "categoryName": "Should Fail",
  "description": "Pharmacists cannot create categories"
}


