# 5. UNIT OF MEASURE (UOM)
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### 5a. Get all active UoMs (seeded: Tablet, Strip, Bottle, Sachet, Packet, Piece, Box)
GET {{base}}/api/uom
Authorization: Bearer {{pharmacistToken}}

###
### 5b. Get UoM by ID (Tablet = 1 from seed)
