Authorization: Bearer {{pharmacistToken}}

###
### 5c. Create a custom UoM
POST {{base}}/api/uom
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "name": "Vial",
  "symbol": "vial"
}

###
### 5d. Update a UoM
PUT {{base}}/api/uom/8
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "name": "Vial",
  "symbol": "vl",
  "isActive": true
}

###
### 5e. Get all including inactive
GET {{base}}/api/uom?includeInactive=true
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}


