# 6. MEDICINE
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### 6a. Create medicine — Amoxicillin (strip-based, 10 tablets per strip)
POST {{base}}/api/medicine
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "name": "Amoxicillin 500mg",
  "genericName": "Amoxicillin",
  "categoryId": 1,
  "manufacturerId": 1,
  "tabletsPerStrip": 10,
  "strapsPerBox": 10,
  "stripPrice": 45.00,
  "tabletPrice": 4.50,
  "reorderLevel": 50,
  "requiresPrescription": true,
  "isActive": true
}

###
### 6b. Create medicine — Paracetamol (15 tablets per strip)
POST {{base}}/api/medicine
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

