### 8a. Add a batch for Amoxicillin (medicine 1)
POST {{base}}/api/medicinebatch
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "medicineId": 1,
  "batchNumber": "AMX-2026-001",
  "supplierId": 1,
  "manufactureDate": "2026-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "expiryDate": "2028-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "quantityInTablets": 1000,
  "purchasePricePerTablet": 3.50,
  "receivedDate": "2026-08-05T00:00:00Z"
}

