###
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# 10. SALES  (with new MedicineUnitId flow)
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# MedicineUnitId references:
#   Medicine 1 (Amoxicillin): Tablet unit ≈ ID 1, Strip unit ≈ ID 2
#   Medicine 2 (Paracetamol): Tablet unit ≈ ID 3, Strip unit ≈ ID 4
#   Use GET /api/medicineunit/pos/{medicineId} to confirm actual IDs.

### 10a. Create sale — selling Amoxicillin in strips + Paracetamol in tablets
POST {{base}}/api/sales
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{pharmacistToken}}

{
  "customerId": 1,
  "pharmacistId": 1,
  "discountPercent": 5,
  "paymentMode": "Cash",
  "items": [
    {
      "medicineId": 1,
      "medicineUnitId": 2,
      "quantity": 3,
      "discountPercent": 0
    },
    {
      "medicineId": 2,
      "medicineUnitId": 3,
      "quantity": 10,
      "discountPercent": 10
    }
  ]
}

###
### 10b. Create sale — selling Ibuprofen by tablet unit with discount
POST {{base}}/api/sales
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{pharmacistToken}}

{
  "customerId": 2,
  "pharmacistId": 1,
  "discountPercent": 0,
  "paymentMode": "Card",
  "items": [
    {
      "medicineId": 3,
      "medicineUnitId": 5,
      "quantity": 20,
      "discountPercent": 5
    }
  ]
}

###
### 10c. Get all sales
GET {{base}}/api/sales
Authorization: Bearer {{pharmacistToken}}

###
### 10d. Get sale by ID
GET {{base}}/api/sales/1
Authorization: Bearer {{pharmacistToken}}

###
### 10e. Test insufficient stock — request more than available
POST {{base}}/api/sales
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{pharmacistToken}}

{
  "customerId": 1,
  "pharmacistId": 1,
  "discountPercent": 0,
  "paymentMode": "Cash",
  "items": [
    {
      "medicineId": 3,
      "medicineUnitId": 5,
      "quantity": 99999,
      "discountPercent": 0
    }
  ]
}

###
### 10f. Test invalid MedicineUnitId — unit not attached to medicine
POST {{base}}/api/sales
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{pharmacistToken}}

{
  "customerId": 1,
  "pharmacistId": 1,
  "discountPercent": 0,
  "paymentMode": "Cash",
  "items": [
    {
      "medicineId": 1,
      "medicineUnitId": 9999,
      "quantity": 1,
      "discountPercent": 0
    }
  ]
}


