###
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# 14. EDGE CASES / SECURITY CHECKS
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### 14a. No token — expect 401
GET {{base}}/api/medicine

###
### 14b. Pharmacist tries to delete a medicine — expect 403
DELETE {{base}}/api/medicine/1
Authorization: Bearer {{pharmacistToken}}

###
### 14c. Admin deletes medicine — expect 200
DELETE {{base}}/api/medicine/3
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###
### 14d. Get deleted medicine — expect 404
GET {{base}}/api/medicine/3
Authorization: Bearer {{pharmacistToken}}

###
### 14e. Delete a category — expect 200
DELETE {{base}}/api/category/2
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###
### 14f. Pharmacist tries to create a UoM — expect 403
POST {{base}}/api/uom
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{pharmacistToken}}

{
  "name": "Should Fail",
  "symbol": "x"
}

###
### 14g. Deactivate a MedicineUnit (non-base unit only)
DELETE {{base}}/api/medicineunit/3
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

